    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "exactly. that's the thing. it's exhausting trying to act like i'm actually here, like these people around me are actually real. it feels like i'm just maintaining a costume so i don't freak everyone out. if i'm already a ghost, why am i still fighting so hard to stay in a body that feels like it's just... occupying space?",
